abstract: "A dependency-free toolkit that audits conversations between students and AI tutors in chat apps: deterministic checks plus an AI judge with a teacher's review grid. Extracted from the daily quality control of Akili, an AI tutor for Ivorian students."
keywords: [education, AI tutor, evaluation, WhatsApp, Africa]
